                                                "text": "Get your rat out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5dd24065-3437-4b68-bbe7-2d0762d53203",
                                                "sense_id": "533d4ea0-adc0-3163-9760-40038b325113",
                                                "text": "I don't need no dating app to tell me if I look like crap / To tell me if I'm thin or fat, to tell me should I shave my rat / I don't need no radio, no MTV, no BBC / I just need a bubble bath to set me on a higher path"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
